  "solution": "**Given:**\n\n160.342 – 32.124\n\n**Concept used:**\n\nDecimal \n\n**Calculations:**\n\n160.342 - 32.124\n\n= 160 + 0.342 - (32 + 0.124)\n\n= 160 - 32 + 0.342 - 0.124\n\n= 128 + 0.218\n\n= 128.218\n\n**Hence, The Required simplified value is 128.218.**",
